  "markdown": "The Wallcovering Guide · Choose and source\n\n# Morris & Co.\n\nMorris & Co. adapts archive designs into wallpaper and fabric collections. Its official history describes a London design studio and UK production. Product-specific ordering and technical information should be confirmed before quantities are settled.\n\n## Source evidence\n\nRead the maker’s information for the selected product and destination. A brand profile does not certify a seller or prove that an order will be accepted.\n\n- [Official source: wmorrisandco.com/uk/about-us](https://www.wmorrisandco.com/uk/about-us/) — checked 17 October 2026\n- [Official source: wmorrisandco.com/uk/owl-willow-wallpaper-bayleaf-orange-44043-217055](https://www.wmorrisandco.com/uk/owl-willow-wallpaper-bayleaf-orange-44043-217055/) — checked 17 October 2026\n- [Official source: wmorrisandco.com/eu/showrooms](https://www.wmorrisandco.com/eu/showrooms/) — checked 17 October 2026\n- [Official source: wmorrisandco.com/uk/terms-conditions](https://www.wmorrisandco.com/uk/terms-conditions/) — checked 17 October 2026\n- [Official source: wmorrisandco.com/uk/sample-service](https://www.wmorrisandco.com/uk/sample-service/) — checked 17 October 2026\n\n[Visit maker website](https://www.wmorrisandco.com/uk/)\n\n## Official sourcing routes\n\nCheck the route’s scope before ordering. Showrooms, samples and finder links do not establish a roll checkout or delivery promise.\n\n### Shop or product ordering\n\nBrowse the selected wallpaper and sample information. The page asks customers to phone to place an order and also displays bag controls; confirm the current ordering process with the maker.\n\n**Region**\n: UK regional store; mainland UK delivery explicitly evidenced\n\n**UK access**\n: UK regional route and mainland delivery are explicit.\n\n**Overseas access**\n: US page directs UK customers here; no UK-store overseas shipment assumed.\n\nMaker-published information; confirm current eligibility and destination before ordering.\n\nTerms and checks before ordering\n\nUK consumer terms govern; commercial use excluded for purchases on that site. Sample service offers five free samples; account necessity not established; ask the maker.\n\nChecked on the official website on 17 October 2026. This check did not include placing an order.\n\n[Open official source: Shop or product ordering, UK regional store; mainland UK delivery explicitly evidenced](https://www.wmorrisandco.com/uk/owl-willow-wallpaper-bayleaf-orange-44043-217055/)\n\n### Showroom or brand contact\n\nUse the official showroom directory to contact or visit the relevant showroom.\n\n**Region**\n: London, UK; Netherlands and US showroom contacts also listed\n\n**UK access**\n: London showroom contact evidenced; retail purchase terms require human confirmation.\n\n**Overseas access**\n: Overseas showroom contacts evidenced; local account and retail terms require confirmation.\n\nMaker-published information; confirm current eligibility and destination before ordering.\n\nTerms and checks before ordering\n\nRetail ordering access, appointment requirements, trade qualification and samples not established; ask the maker.\n\nChecked on the official website on 17 October 2026. This check did not include placing an order.\n\n[Open official source: Showroom or brand contact, London, UK; Netherlands and US showroom contacts also listed](https://www.wmorrisandco.com/eu/showrooms/)\n\n[All makers](https://www.mrwallcover.com/makers/)\n\n## From sample to specification\n\nRecord the exact design and product code, check current instructions and establish the wall preparation before quantities and installation are agreed.\n\n[Discuss your wallcovering](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/?intent=source)\n\nBy [Dorin Burcus](https://www.mrwallcover.com/about/#dorin), founder · Last updated 18 October 2026\n",
